msgid "saving_interval"
msgstr "New version after … seconds"

msgid "saving_interval_byline"
msgstr "After the specified editing time, ILIAS automatically publishes a new version of the file when the external editor reports changes. By default, ILIAS adds all changes received from the editor as a draft only, until a new file version is manually published. Please note that using this option with a low value can lead to a large number of file versions, which takes up a lot of storage space."

