msgstr "Complete URL of the WOPI Discovery, which must be accessible via the ILIAS server. The XML data of the Discovery is read and saved by ILIAS. This information is regularly updated by the cronjob \"Update WOPI Discovery\". Example: https://example.org/hosting/discovery"
